<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 235 0 R
/E (On 13th February 2025, the EC Department of GEC Patan organized a MOOC Sensitization program for first-year students, coordinated by Prof. S.A. Pankhaniya and Prof. R.A. Chaudhari. The session introduced the concept, benefits, and GTU guidelines of MOOCs, along with relevant courses for various branches. It aimed to promote digital learning and encourage students to explore opportunities beyond the traditional curriculum. An interactive Q&A session helped address student queries and increased interest in MOOCs. The event resulted in greater awareness of online learning platforms and highlighted their role in enhancing academic and career growth.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
