>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (Eminent guests Dr. Ruchit Patel and Dr. Jinal Sarvi from Kungher Health Center addressed the students, along with the college principal Dr. B. J. Shah, who motivated attendees to embrace a tobacco-free life. The seminar began with a Deep Pragatya ceremony and the NSS Song, highlighting the values of the NSS. An elocution competition was also held as part of the event, where students actively shared their thoughts on tobacco9s impact and healthy living. Winners and participants were felicitated with prizes and certificates, marking a successful conclusion to the awareness initiative.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [15]
>>
